<title>TURKEY: Turkish firm to import 15,000 T Syrian durum wheat.</title>
<headline>Turkish firm to import 15,000 T Syrian durum wheat.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Turkish pasta producer is planning to import 15,000 tonnes of durum wheat from Syria to be delivered in November and December, traders said on Thursday.</p>
</text>
